Subject: [PATCH] fix: align watch recovery tests with bookmark behavior

Upstream-commit: 2f8942443fb7d0385ae18adea74f04b6a34a6aec

Retain resource-expiry, unknown-error threshold and connection-refused coverage with the backported recovery behavior.
